/*!
    \page index.html
    \title Qt Branded Template Example
    \brief Exercises the Qt-branded page template with toolbar and CDN logo.

    This page exists to validate that the template generator, when pointed
    at an external template directory, renders the Qt brand layer correctly:
    dark header, Qt green accents, CDN logo, three-button toolbar with
    Claude and ChatGPT as the only AI providers, and the Qt copyright
    footer. The neutral default templates remain untouched; branding is
    applied solely through \c{TemplateHTML.templatedir}.
*/
